{"data":{"current_mention_tongjian_id":"8c2df16f-db0e-11ef-9ccf-a0d3651f611f","current_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8c2df162-db0e-11ef-8acb-a0d3651f611f","occurrence_page":{"anchor_paragraph_order":0,"current_page":1,"items":[{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"渭城","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"魏其侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"魏其侯","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"8f87220e-db0e-11ef-b902-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"武安侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"武安侯","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"8f87220f-db0e-11ef-a3c0-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"蚡","people_name_jianti_auto":"蚡","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"8f872210-db0e-11ef-9c18-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"班固","people_name_jianti_auto":"班固","start_index":55,"tongjian_id":"8f872211-db0e-11ef-a6b1-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"竇嬰","people_name_jianti_auto":"窦婴","start_index":75,"tongjian_id":"8f872212-db0e-11ef-994f-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"田蚡","people_name_jianti_auto":"田蚡","start_index":89,"tongjian_id":"8f872213-db0e-11ef-b01a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"嬰","people_name_jianti_auto":"婴","start_index":129,"tongjian_id":"8f872214-db0e-11ef-ae9e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"班固","people_name_jianti_auto":"班固","start_index":144,"tongjian_id":"8f872215-db0e-11ef-9992-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8f872216-db0e-11ef-9611-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"渭城縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"渭城县","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"8f872217-db0e-11ef-8731-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"扶風","place_name_jianti_auto":"扶风","start_index":42,"tongjian_id":"8f872218-db0e-11ef-aaf6-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":45,"tongjian_id":"8f872219-db0e-11ef-862c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"咸陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"咸阳","start_index":47,"tongjian_id":"8f87221a-db0e-11ef-8b1d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"漢法，以冬月行重刑，遇春則赦若贖，故以十二月晦論殺魏其侯。此武安侯蚡之意也。渭城縣屬扶風，秦之咸陽也。考異曰：班固漢武故事曰：「上召大臣議之。羣臣多是竇嬰，上亦不復窮問，兩罷之。田蚡大恨，欲自殺；先與太后訣，兄弟共號哭訴太后，太后亦哭，弗食。上不得已，遂乃殺嬰。」按漢武故事，語多誕妄，非班固書；蓋後人爲之，託固名耳。","note_content_jianti_auto":"汉法，以冬月行重刑，遇春则赦若赎，故以十二月晦论杀魏其侯。此武安侯蚡之意也。渭城县属扶风，秦之咸阳也。考异曰：班固汉武故事曰：「上召大臣议之。群臣多是窦婴，上亦不复穷问，两罢之。田蚡大恨，欲自杀；先与太后诀，兄弟共号哭诉太后，太后亦哭，弗食。上不得已，遂乃杀婴。」按汉武故事，语多诞妄，非班固书；盖后人为之，托固名耳。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"8f87220d-db0e-11ef-be7f-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"灌夫","people_name_jianti_auto":"灌夫","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"8f87221f-db0e-11ef-a3ce-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"灌夫","people_name_jianti_auto":"灌夫","start_index":37,"tongjian_id":"8f872220-db0e-11ef-96be-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"魏其","people_name_jianti_auto":"魏其","start_index":49,"tongjian_id":"8f872221-db0e-11ef-8466-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"徐廣","people_name_jianti_auto":"徐广","start_index":55,"tongjian_id":"8f872222-db0e-11ef-8ca6-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"蚡","people_name_jianti_auto":"蚡","start_index":68,"tongjian_id":"8f872223-db0e-11ef-bf02-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"嬰","people_name_jianti_auto":"婴","start_index":71,"tongjian_id":"8f872224-db0e-11ef-9aa0-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"廣","people_name_jianti_auto":"广","start_index":95,"tongjian_id":"8f872225-db0e-11ef-8f14-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"蚡","people_name_jianti_auto":"蚡","start_index":119,"tongjian_id":"8f872226-db0e-11ef-b570-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"魏其","people_name_jianti_auto":"魏其","start_index":121,"tongjian_id":"8f872227-db0e-11ef-a84b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":106,"tongjian_id":"8f872228-db0e-11ef-a2cb-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"考異曰：武安侯傳云：「元光四年春，丞相按灌夫事；其夏，取夫人。五年十月，論灌夫及家屬。十二月，晦，魏其棄市。」徐廣引武帝本紀、侯表，以爲蚡薨在嬰死後分明，四年當是三年，五年當是四年。今從之。廣又疑十二月爲二月；按漢制，常以立春下寬大詔書，蚡恐魏其得釋，故以十二月晦殺之，何必改爲二月也！","note_content_jianti_auto":"考异曰：武安侯传云：「元光四年春，丞相按灌夫事；其夏，取夫人。五年十月，论灌夫及家属。十二月，晦，魏其弃市。」徐广引武帝本纪、侯表，以为蚡薨在婴死后分明，四年当是三年，五年当是四年。今从之。广又疑十二月为二月；按汉制，常以立春下宽大诏书，蚡恐魏其得释，故以十二月晦杀之，何必改为二月也！","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"8f87221e-db0e-11ef-a3c7-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[{"relation_type":"forward_reference","source_end_index":9,"source_start_index":0,"source_text":"見後十九卷元狩元年","target_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8fba3aa3-db0e-11ef-9be9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"見後十九卷元狩元年。","note_content_jianti_auto":"见后十九卷元狩元年。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"8f87222d-db0e-11ef-a098-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[{"relation_type":"back_reference","source_end_index":7,"source_start_index":0,"source_text":"見上卷建元二年","target_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8f56b2ad-db0e-11ef-a2ac-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"見上卷建元二年。","note_content_jianti_auto":"见上卷建元二年。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":50,"tongjian_id":"8f87222e-db0e-11ef-b29e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"渭城","place_name_jianti_auto":"渭城","place_note":"陝西咸陽","resolved_place_entity_id":1950,"start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"8f872230-db0e-11ef-9ac7-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"容斋随笔/汉母后","excerpts":[{"context_after":"韩嫣得幸于上，江都王为太后泣，请得入宿卫比嫣，后繇此衔嫣...","context_before":"...东宫，后大怒，求得二人奸利事以责上，上下绾、臧吏，杀之。","source_end_index":294,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"9be3ffd2-3469-42c6-8678-33be0f520187","source_start_index":241,"source_text":"窦婴、田蚡廷辩，王太后大怒不食，曰：“我在也，而人皆藉吾弟，且帝宁能为石人邪！”帝不直蚡，特为太后故杀婴。"}],"path":"随笔/卷二/汉母后","source_name":"容斋随笔"},{"display_title":"容斋随笔/汉武帝田蚡公孙弘","excerpts":[{"context_after":"；于公孙弘则云性意忌，外宽内深，饰诈钓名，不为贤大夫所称...","context_before":"...奢极侈，置生民于涂炭；于田蚡则诋其负贵骄溢，以肺腑为相，","source_end_index":60,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"c0382e57-bfaa-49df-8f96-9de1acd71461","source_start_index":54,"source_text":"杀窦婴、灌夫"}],"path":"五笔/卷四/汉武帝田蚡公孙弘","source_name":"容斋随笔"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"1冬，十二月晦，論殺魏其於渭城。春，三月，乙卯，武安侯蚡亦薨。及淮南王安敗，上聞蚡受安金，有不順語，曰：「使武安侯在者，族矣！」","content_fanyi":"冬季十二月的最后一天，魏其侯窦婴在渭城被按所定罪状处死。春季三月乙卯日，武安侯田蚡也去世了。等到淮南王刘安谋反事败后，武帝得知田蚡曾接受刘安的黄金，还说过悖逆犯上的话，于是说：“假使武安侯还活着，就要灭他的族了！”","content_jianti_auto":"1冬，十二月晦，论杀魏其于渭城。春，三月，乙卯，武安侯蚡亦薨。及淮南王安败，上闻蚡受安金，有不顺语，曰：「使武安侯在者，族矣！」","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":1437,"number":1,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第十八 (漢紀十) / 世宗孝武皇帝上之下 / 四年 / 第 1 段","reading_annotation_sources":[{"count":2,"source":"资治通鉴考异","source_key":"资治通鉴考异"}],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8f87220c-db0e-11ef-8e6b-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-131},"tongjian_id":"8f87220c-db0e-11ef-8e6b-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"渭城","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"史","people_name_jianti_auto":"史","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"90ae241b-db0e-11ef-a4d3-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"史佚","people_name_jianti_auto":"史佚","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"90ae241c-db0e-11ef-9ddb-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"90ae241d-db0e-11ef-8f74-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"周","place_name_jianti_auto":"周","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"90ae241e-db0e-11ef-9242-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"姓譜：史，周史佚之後。師古曰：太子有妃，有良娣，有孺子，凡三等。","note_content_jianti_auto":"姓谱：史，周史佚之后。师古曰：太子有妃，有良娣，有孺子，凡三等。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"90ae241a-db0e-11ef-8ac2-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"90ae2421-db0e-11ef-a26b-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"進","people_name_jianti_auto":"进","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"90ae2422-db0e-11ef-a1d5-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：進，皇孫之名也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：进，皇孙之名也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"90ae2420-db0e-11ef-a2c2-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"王夫人","people_name_jianti_auto":"王夫人","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"90ae2424-db0e-11ef-a116-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"涿郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"涿郡","place_note":"河北涿州","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"90ae2425-db0e-11ef-8e2d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"幽州","place_name_jianti_auto":"幽州","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"90ae2426-db0e-11ef-b990-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"涿郡屬幽州。王夫人，名翁須。","note_content_jianti_auto":"涿郡属幽州。王夫人，名翁须。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"90ae2423-db0e-11ef-9948-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"90ae2428-db0e-11ef-af76-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"病已","people_name_jianti_auto":"病已","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"90ae2429-db0e-11ef-9800-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"詢","people_name_jianti_auto":"询","start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"90ae242a-db0e-11ef-b002-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：蓋以夙遭屯難而多病苦，故名病已，欲其速差也；後以爲鄙，更改諱詢。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：盖以夙遭屯难而多病苦，故名病已，欲其速差也；后以为鄙，更改讳询。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"90ae2427-db0e-11ef-97d5-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[{"relation_type":"explicit_reference","source_end_index":11,"source_start_index":0,"source_text":"見二十二卷武帝征和二年","target_paragraph_tongjian_id":"90648977-db0e-11ef-82ea-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"武帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"武帝","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"90ae242c-db0e-11ef-99d1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"見二十二卷武帝征和二年。","note_content_jianti_auto":"见二十二卷武帝征和二年。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":53,"tongjian_id":"90ae242b-db0e-11ef-95ff-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"90ae242e-db0e-11ef-b2a8-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：漢舊儀：郡邸獄，治天下郡國上計者，屬大鴻臚。此蓋巫蠱獄收繫者衆，故皇曾孫寄在郡邸獄。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：汉旧仪：郡邸狱，治天下郡国上计者，属大鸿胪。此盖巫蛊狱收系者众，故皇曾孙寄在郡邸狱。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":83,"tongjian_id":"90ae242d-db0e-11ef-9eef-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"班","people_name_jianti_auto":"班","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"90ae2431-db0e-11ef-aaf9-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"丙","people_name_jianti_auto":"丙","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"90ae2432-db0e-11ef-9988-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"丙歜","people_name_jianti_auto":"丙歜","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"90ae2433-db0e-11ef-b0ae-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"高苑侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"高苑侯","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"90ae2434-db0e-11ef-b85b-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"丙倩","people_name_jianti_auto":"丙倩","start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"90ae2435-db0e-11ef-8a05-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"齊","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"90ae2436-db0e-11ef-a191-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"班表：廷尉有左、右監，秩千石。丙，姓也。左傳齊有丙歜。功臣表有高苑侯丙倩。","note_content_jianti_auto":"班表：廷尉有左、右监，秩千石。丙，姓也。左传齐有丙歜。功臣表有高苑侯丙倩。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":91,"tongjian_id":"90ae2430-db0e-11ef-ba57-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"90ae243c-db0e-11ef-8866-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：重，音直用翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：重，音直用翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":115,"tongjian_id":"90ae243b-db0e-11ef-8baf-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"李奇","people_name_jianti_auto":"李奇","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"90ae243e-db0e-11ef-9170-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"班","people_name_jianti_auto":"班","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"90ae243f-db0e-11ef-b18b-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"班","people_name_jianti_auto":"班","start_index":58,"tongjian_id":"90ae2440-db0e-11ef-b704-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":68,"tongjian_id":"90ae2441-db0e-11ef-98f5-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"渭城縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"渭城县","start_index":61,"tongjian_id":"90ae2442-db0e-11ef-9a3b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"扶風","place_name_jianti_auto":"扶风","start_index":65,"tongjian_id":"90ae2443-db0e-11ef-8ce9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"李奇曰：輕罪，男子守邊一歲；女子輭弱不任守，復令作於官，亦一歲；故班史謂之女徒復作。復作者，復爲官作，滿其本罪月日。班志，渭城縣屬扶風。師古曰：閒，寬淨之處也。燥，高敞也。閒，讀曰閑。燥，蘇老翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"李奇曰：轻罪，男子守边一岁；女子輭弱不任守，复令作于官，亦一岁；故班史谓之女徒复作。复作者，复为官作，满其本罪月日。班志，渭城县属扶风。师古曰：闲，宽净之处也。燥，高敞也。闲，读曰闲。燥，苏老翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":142,"tongjian_id":"90ae243d-db0e-11ef-a4e7-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"90ae2419-db0e-11ef-83e5-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"dì","source_anchor_text":"魯國史良娣生子進號","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":11,"text":"娣","tongjian_id":"3423f05c-145d-5c2a-9202-0793018f362a"},{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"90ae2419-db0e-11ef-83e5-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"zhuō","source_anchor_text":"孫皇孫納涿郡王夫人","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":25,"text":"涿","tongjian_id":"c06a0d03-39b7-5efd-96db-d53f397b4aed"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"渭城","place_name_jianti_auto":"渭城","place_note":"陝西咸陽","resolved_place_entity_id":1950,"start_index":120,"tongjian_id":"90ae2454-db0e-11ef-b3f6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"容斋随笔/戾太子","excerpts":[{"context_after":"，至于掖庭令养视而不问也，岂非汉法至严，既坐太子以反逆之...","context_before":"...族。田千秋以一言至为丞相，又作思子宫，为归来望思之台。然","source_end_index":88,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"2e2f5cd8-ddf0-4ba0-8d30-2129c96e7422","source_start_index":74,"source_text":"其孤孙囚系于郡邸，独不能释之"}],"path":"随笔/卷二/戾太子","source_name":"容斋随笔"},{"display_title":"容斋随笔/丙午丁未","excerpts":[{"context_after":"。昭帝元平元年丁未，帝崩，昌邑立而复废，一岁再易主。成帝...","context_before":"...命将出征匈奴，自是之后，师行三十年，屠夷死灭，不可胜数，","source_end_index":129,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"7f29e9e3-b788-4595-81c4-830eb54b702f","source_start_index":116,"source_text":"及于巫蛊之祸，太子子父皆败"}],"path":"五笔/卷十/丙午丁未","source_name":"容斋随笔"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"5初，衞太子納魯國史良娣，生子進，號史皇孫。皇孫納涿郡王夫人，生子病已，號皇曾孫。皇曾孫生數月，遭巫蠱事，太子三男、一女及諸妻、妾皆遇害，獨皇曾孫在，亦坐收繫郡邸獄。故廷尉監魯國丙吉受詔治巫蠱獄，吉心知太子無事實，重哀皇曾孫無辜，擇謹厚女徒渭城胡組、淮陽郭徵卿，令乳養曾孫，置閒燥處。吉日再省視。","content_fanyi":"当初，卫太子刘据纳鲁国史氏女子为良娣，生下儿子刘进，号称史皇孙。史皇孙刘进娶涿郡王夫人为妻，生下儿子刘病已，号称皇曾孙。皇曾孙出生才几个月，就遭遇巫蛊之祸，卫太子刘据及其三个儿子、一个女儿，以及他的众妻妾全部遇害，只有皇曾孙一人活了下来，但也受连累被收捕囚禁在大鸿胪所属的郡邸狱。原任廷尉监的鲁国人丙吉接受汉武帝诏令审理巫蛊案，心中知道太子刘据并无犯罪事实，深深哀怜皇曾孙无辜，于是挑选谨慎忠厚的女刑徒渭城人胡组、淮阳人郭徵卿，让她们喂养皇曾孙，并安置在宽敞干燥的地方。丙吉每天两次前往探视。","content_jianti_auto":"5初，衞太子纳鲁国史良娣，生子进，号史皇孙。皇孙纳涿郡王夫人，生子病已，号皇曾孙。皇曾孙生数月，遭巫蛊事，太子三男、一女及诸妻、妾皆遇害，独皇曾孙在，亦坐收系郡邸狱。故廷尉监鲁国丙吉受诏治巫蛊狱，吉心知太子无事实，重哀皇曾孙无辜，择谨厚女徒渭城胡组、淮阳郭征卿，令乳养曾孙，置闲燥处。吉日再省视。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[{"excerpts":[{"context_after":"，故能相天子以成中兴之业。然则汉文却周勃之私言，世庙罢新...","context_before":"...任为己绩者？赵汝愚不欲行内禅之赏，可法也，而犹存其迹也；","source_end_index":188,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"9a09d43f-4292-4b10-a4ed-96fd7c9ec34f","source_start_index":176,"source_text":"丙吉护宣帝于狱而终不自白"}],"title":"七 汉亡非元帝之过"}],"id":1954,"number":5,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二十四 (漢紀十六) / 孝昭皇帝下 / 元平元年 / 第 22 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"90ae2419-db0e-11ef-83e5-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-74},"tongjian_id":"90ae2419-db0e-11ef-83e5-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":2},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"渭城","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"90f37c60-db0e-11ef-8901-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：遭遇，謂升大位也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：遭遇，谓升大位也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"90f37c5f-db0e-11ef-a92f-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"章","people_name_jianti_auto":"章","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"90f37c63-db0e-11ef-93d9-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孔","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"90f37c64-db0e-11ef-b461-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"熊","people_name_jianti_auto":"熊","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"90f37c65-db0e-11ef-9c35-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"note_content":"『章：甲十五行本「言」作「吉」；乙十一行本同；孔本同；熊校同。』","note_content_jianti_auto":"『章：甲十五行本「言」作「吉」；乙十一行本同；孔本同；熊校同。』","note_type":"『章：[^』]*』","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"90f37c62-db0e-11ef-81d9-a0d3651f611f"}],"note_content":"","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"90f37c61-db0e-11ef-b544-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"90f37c67-db0e-11ef-927a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：謂未爲宮婢時有舊夫，見在俗間者。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：谓未为宫婢时有旧夫，见在俗间者。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":56,"tongjian_id":"90f37c66-db0e-11ef-bbf1-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"90f37c6a-db0e-11ef-b338-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：視，讀曰示。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：视，读曰示。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":87,"tongjian_id":"90f37c69-db0e-11ef-8f2b-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"90f37c6c-db0e-11ef-9135-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：督，謂視察之。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：督，谓视察之。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":109,"tongjian_id":"90f37c6b-db0e-11ef-98aa-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"渭城","place_name_jianti_auto":"渭城","place_note":"陝西咸陽","resolved_place_entity_id":1950,"start_index":116,"tongjian_id":"90f37c78-db0e-11ef-9bab-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"丙吉爲人深厚，不伐善。自曾孫遭遇，言絕口不道前恩，故朝廷莫能明其功也。會掖庭宮婢則令民夫上書，自陳嘗有阿保之功，章下掖庭令考問，則辭引使者丙吉知狀。掖庭令將則詣御史府以視吉，吉識，謂則曰：「汝嘗坐養皇曾孫不謹，督笞汝，汝安得有功！獨渭城胡組、淮陽郭徵卿有恩耳。」分別奏組等共養勞苦狀。詔吉求組、徵卿；已死，有子孫，皆受厚賞。詔免則爲庶人，賜錢十萬。上親見問，然後知吉有舊恩而終不言，上大賢之。","content_fanyi":"丙吉为人深沉厚道，从不夸耀自己的功劳。自从皇曾孙即位以来，丙吉绝口不提从前对汉宣帝的救助之恩，所以朝廷中没有人能知晓他的功劳。恰逢一个名叫则的掖庭宫婢让她的平民丈夫上书，自己陈述曾有抚养保育皇帝的功劳；奏章下交掖庭令查问，则的供词引出使者丙吉，说他知道当时情况。掖庭令带着则到御史府去见丙吉，丙吉认出了她，对则说：“你曾经因为抚养皇曾孙不谨慎，我督责鞭打过你，你哪里有什么功劳！只有渭城胡组、淮阳郭徵卿对当今皇上有恩罢了。”于是分别奏明胡组等人共同抚养的劳苦情状。宣帝下诏让丙吉寻找胡组、郭徵卿；二人已经去世，留有子孙，都得到了丰厚的赏赐。宣帝又下诏将则免为平民，赐钱十万。皇上亲自召见询问她，这才知道丙吉对自己有旧恩却始终不肯说出，宣帝深为赞赏他的贤德。","content_jianti_auto":"丙吉为人深厚，不伐善。自曾孙遭遇，言绝口不道前恩，故朝廷莫能明其功也。会掖庭宫婢则令民夫上书，自陈尝有阿保之功，章下掖庭令考问，则辞引使者丙吉知状。掖庭令将则诣御史府以视吉，吉识，谓则曰：「汝尝坐养皇曾孙不谨，督笞汝，汝安得有功！独渭城胡组、淮阳郭征卿有恩耳。」分别奏组等共养劳苦状。诏吉求组、征卿；已死，有子孙，皆受厚赏。诏免则为庶人，赐钱十万。上亲见问，然后知吉有旧恩而终不言，上大贤之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[{"excerpts":[{"context_after":"，故能相天子以成中兴之业。然则汉文却周勃之私言，世庙罢新...","context_before":"...任为己绩者？赵汝愚不欲行内禅之赏，可法也，而犹存其迹也；","source_end_index":188,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"9a09d43f-4292-4b10-a4ed-96fd7c9ec34f","source_start_index":176,"source_text":"丙吉护宣帝于狱而终不自白"}],"title":"七 汉亡非元帝之过"}],"id":2054,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二十五 (漢紀十七) / 中宗孝宣皇帝上之下 / 二年 / 第 8 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"90f37c5e-db0e-11ef-a4b2-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-64},"tongjian_id":"90f37c5e-db0e-11ef-a4b2-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":3},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"渭城","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"912aef8b-db0e-11ef-b01f-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"望之","people_name_jianti_auto":"望之","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"912aef8c-db0e-11ef-b594-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"延壽","people_name_jianti_auto":"延寿","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"912aef8d-db0e-11ef-b91d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：望之以延壽代己爲馮翊，而有能名出己之上，故忌害之，欲陷以罪法。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：望之以延寿代己为冯翊，而有能名出己之上，故忌害之，欲陷以罪法。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"912aef8a-db0e-11ef-a407-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"912aef8f-db0e-11ef-b9fa-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"左馮翊","place_name_jianti_auto":"左冯翊","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"912aef90-db0e-11ef-9fd1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"左馮翊屬官有廩犧令、丞、尉。師古曰：廩，主藏穀；犧，主養牲；皆所以供祭祀也。校，居孝翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"左冯翊属官有廪牺令、丞、尉。师古曰：廪，主藏谷；牺，主养牲；皆所以供祭祀也。校，居孝翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":62,"tongjian_id":"912aef8e-db0e-11ef-8cb8-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"章","people_name_jianti_auto":"章","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"912aef94-db0e-11ef-8626-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孔","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"912aef95-db0e-11ef-a40b-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"退齋","people_name_jianti_auto":"退斋","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"912aef96-db0e-11ef-82c8-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"note_content":"『章：甲十五行本「日」下有「車服侍衞」四字；乙十一行本同；孔本同；退齋校同。』","note_content_jianti_auto":"『章：甲十五行本「日」下有「车服侍衞」四字；乙十一行本同；孔本同；退斋校同。』","note_type":"『章：[^』]*』","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"912aef93-db0e-11ef-8be6-a0d3651f611f"}],"note_content":"","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":130,"tongjian_id":"912aef92-db0e-11ef-9af9-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"912aef98-db0e-11ef-b264-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"延壽","people_name_jianti_auto":"延寿","start_index":39,"tongjian_id":"912aef99-db0e-11ef-ab99-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"延壽","people_name_jianti_auto":"延寿","start_index":113,"tongjian_id":"912aef9a-db0e-11ef-9bdb-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"延壽","people_name_jianti_auto":"延寿","start_index":122,"tongjian_id":"912aef9b-db0e-11ef-895f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"楚","place_name_jianti_auto":"楚","start_index":119,"tongjian_id":"912aef9c-db0e-11ef-9236-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：試騎士，每歲大試也。余謂卽都試也。據延壽傳：治飾兵車，畫龍、虎、朱爵。延壽衣黃紈方領，駕四馬，傅總，建幢棨、植羽葆，鼓車、歌車。功曹引車，皆駕四馬，建棨戟。五騎爲伍，分左右部，軍假司馬、千人持幢旁轂。歌者先居射室，望見延壽車，噭咷楚歌。延壽坐射室，騎吏持戟夾陛列立，騎士從者帶弓鞬羅後。令騎士、兵車四面營陳，被甲鞮鍪，居馬上，抱弩負籣。又使騎士戲車、弄馬、盜驂。所謂奢僭踰制者也。噭，音叫。咷，音他釣翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：试骑士，每岁大试也。余谓即都试也。据延寿传：治饰兵车，画龙、虎、朱爵。延寿衣黄纨方领，驾四马，傅总，建幢棨、植羽葆，鼓车、歌车。功曹引车，皆驾四马，建棨戟。五骑为伍，分左右部，军假司马、千人持幢旁毂。歌者先居射室，望见延寿车，噭咷楚歌。延寿坐射室，骑吏持戟夹陛列立，骑士从者带弓鞬罗后。令骑士、兵车四面营陈，被甲鞮鍪，居马上，抱弩负籣。又使骑士戏车、弄马、盗骖。所谓奢僭逾制者也。噭，音叫。咷，音他钓翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":135,"tongjian_id":"912aef97-db0e-11ef-854d-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"章","people_name_jianti_auto":"章","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"912aefa0-db0e-11ef-adae-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"note_content":"『章：甲十五行本無「劍」字；乙十一行本同。』","note_content_jianti_auto":"『章：甲十五行本无「剑」字；乙十一行本同。』","note_type":"『章：[^』]*』","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"912aef9f-db0e-11ef-8133-a0d3651f611f"}],"note_content":"","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":148,"tongjian_id":"912aef9e-db0e-11ef-a4a0-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"912aefa2-db0e-11ef-807f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"912aefa3-db0e-11ef-917f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"據劉向傳，上令典尚方鑄作事。師古註曰：尚方，鑄巧作金銀之所，若今之中尚署。又漢制尚方主作御刀劍。","note_content_jianti_auto":"据刘向传，上令典尚方铸作事。师古注曰：尚方，铸巧作金银之所，若今之中尚署。又汉制尚方主作御刀剑。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":153,"tongjian_id":"912aefa1-db0e-11ef-a780-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"章","people_name_jianti_auto":"章","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"912aefa8-db0e-11ef-8bc0-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孔","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"912aefa9-db0e-11ef-93fe-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"張","people_name_jianti_auto":"张","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"912aefaa-db0e-11ef-87b5-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"note_content":"『章：十五行本「錢」下有「帛」字；乙十一行本同；孔本同；張校同。』","note_content_jianti_auto":"『章：十五行本「钱」下有「帛」字；乙十一行本同；孔本同；张校同。』","note_type":"『章：[^』]*』","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"912aefa7-db0e-11ef-bd74-a0d3651f611f"}],"note_content":"","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":157,"tongjian_id":"912aefa6-db0e-11ef-91f0-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"912aefac-db0e-11ef-acda-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：假，謂顧賃也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：假，谓顾赁也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":163,"tongjian_id":"912aefab-db0e-11ef-8c7a-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"912aefaf-db0e-11ef-9df0-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：奏，進也。炙，之夜翻，燔肉也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：奏，进也。炙，之夜翻，燔肉也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":208,"tongjian_id":"912aefae-db0e-11ef-a2f0-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"912aef89-db0e-11ef-9e0c-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"lǐn","source_anchor_text":"在馮翊時廩犧官錢放","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":52,"text":"廩","tongjian_id":"23f9272a-6a68-57a0-ac80-5face3486362"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"渭城","place_name_jianti_auto":"渭城","place_note":"陝西咸陽","resolved_place_entity_id":1950,"start_index":193,"tongjian_id":"912aefbf-db0e-11ef-85e2-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"容斋随笔/二疏赞","excerpts":[{"context_after":"，又三年杨恽诛。方二疏去时，三人皆亡恙。盖先生文如倾河，...","context_before":"...。然以其时考之，元康三年二疏去位，后二年盖宽饶诛，又三年","source_end_index":118,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"dcd2858e-d703-4959-8e62-90b5774b4611","source_start_index":114,"source_text":"韩延寿诛"}],"path":"随笔/卷四/二疏赞","source_name":"容斋随笔"},{"display_title":"容斋随笔/魏相萧望之","excerpts":[{"context_after":"。魏、萧贤公卿也，忍以其私陷二材臣于死地乎？杨恽坐语言怨...","context_before":"赵广汉之死由魏相，","source_end_index":18,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"98c62c48-c10c-4022-b575-404965a57820","source_start_index":9,"source_text":"韩延寿之死由萧望之"}],"path":"随笔/卷六/魏相萧望之","source_name":"容斋随笔"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"5韓延壽代蕭望之爲左馮翊。望之聞延壽在東郡時放散官錢千餘萬，使御史案之。延壽聞知，卽部吏案校望之在馮翊時廩犧官錢放散百餘萬。望之自奏：「職在總領天下，聞事不敢不問，而爲延壽所拘持。」上由是不直延壽，各令窮竟所考。望之卒無事實。而望之遣御史案東郡者，得其試騎士日奢僭踰制；又取官銅物，候月食鑄刀劍，效尚方事；及取官錢私假徭使吏；及治飾車甲三百萬以上。延壽竟坐狡猾不道，棄市。吏民數千人送至渭城，老小扶持車轂，爭奏酒炙。延壽不忍距逆，人人爲飲，計飲酒石餘。使掾、史分謝送者：「遠苦吏民，延壽死無所恨！」百姓莫不流涕。","content_fanyi":"韩延寿接替萧望之担任左冯翊。萧望之听说韩延寿在东郡太守任上时发放、耗散官府钱款一千多万，就派御史查办他。韩延寿得知后，也部署属吏核查萧望之在左冯翊任上耗散廪牺令所管官钱一百多万的事。萧望之上奏说：“我的职责在于总领天下，听到事情不敢不查问，现在却被韩延寿所挟制。”宣帝因此不认为韩延寿有理，下令对双方所查之事都追查到底。萧望之最终没有被查出实据。而萧望之派去东郡的御史，却查到韩延寿在考试骑士那天奢侈僭越、超越规定；又取用官府铜料，趁月食时铸造刀剑，仿照尚方署的做法；还取用官府钱私自出借，擅自役使吏员；又修治装饰车辆甲胄，花费三百多万钱。韩延寿最终因狡猾不道之罪被处弃市。数千名官吏百姓送他到渭城，老人小孩扶住车毂，争相进献酒和烤肉。韩延寿不忍心拒绝，对每个人敬的酒都喝了，总计饮酒一石多。他让掾、史等属吏分别向送行者道谢说：“让各位吏民远来受苦，延寿死而无憾！”百姓无不流泪。","content_jianti_auto":"5韩延寿代萧望之为左冯翊。望之闻延寿在东郡时放散官钱千余万，使御史案之。延寿闻知，即部吏案校望之在冯翊时廪牺官钱放散百余万。望之自奏：「职在总领天下，闻事不敢不问，而为延寿所拘持。」上由是不直延寿，各令穷竟所考。望之卒无事实。而望之遣御史案东郡者，得其试骑士日奢僭逾制；又取官铜物，候月食铸刀剑，效尚方事；及取官钱私假徭使吏；及治饰车甲三百万以上。延寿竟坐狡猾不道，弃市。吏民数千人送至渭城，老小扶持车毂，争奏酒炙。延寿不忍距逆，人人为饮，计饮酒石余。使掾、史分谢送者：「远苦吏民，延寿死无所恨！」百姓莫不流涕。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[{"excerpts":[{"context_after":"丙吉贤相也，则倨慢无礼而以老侮之。且不但已也，出补平原太...","context_before":"...相御史欲位之王侯之下，望之则曰：“待以不臣，谦亨之福。”","source_end_index":173,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"39482594-52ec-4156-93a8-9b6464425ccb","source_start_index":153,"source_text":"韩延寿良吏也，忌其名而讦其小过以陷之死。"}],"title":"一八 萧望之难以大受"}],"id":2126,"number":5,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二十七 (漢紀十九) / 中宗孝宣皇帝下 / 五鳳元年 / 第 6 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"912aef89-db0e-11ef-9e0c-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-57},"tongjian_id":"912aef89-db0e-11ef-9e0c-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":4},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"渭城","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"918bba48-db0e-11ef-898a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"三輔","place_name_jianti_auto":"三辅","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"918bba49-db0e-11ef-8c00-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：先是諸陵總屬太常，今各依其地界屬三輔。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：先是诸陵总属太常，今各依其地界属三辅。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"918bba47-db0e-11ef-a445-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"服虔","people_name_jianti_auto":"服虔","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"918bba4b-db0e-11ef-b77e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"元帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"元帝","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"918bba4c-db0e-11ef-af74-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"服虔曰：元帝所置陵也；未有名，故曰初。","note_content_jianti_auto":"服虔曰：元帝所置陵也；未有名，故曰初。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"918bba4a-db0e-11ef-901e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"渭城","place_name_jianti_auto":"渭城","resolved_place_entity_id":1950,"start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"918bba4e-db0e-11ef-8947-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"6諸陵分屬三輔。以渭城壽陵亭部原上爲初陵；詔勿置縣邑及徙郡國民。","content_fanyi":"各座皇帝陵园及其所属地区，分别隶属三辅管辖。将渭城寿陵亭部原上定为初陵；下诏不要设置县邑，也不要迁徙各郡、各封国的百姓到那里。","content_jianti_auto":"6诸陵分属三辅。以渭城寿陵亭部原上为初陵；诏勿置县邑及徙郡国民。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":2264,"number":6,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二十九 (漢紀二十一) / 孝元皇帝下 / 四年 / 第 6 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"918bba46-db0e-11ef-8b0e-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-40},"tongjian_id":"918bba46-db0e-11ef-8b0e-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":5},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"渭城","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"渭城","place_name_jianti_auto":"渭城","resolved_place_entity_id":1950,"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"91bbcdcb-db0e-11ef-bb10-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"2閏月，以渭城延陵亭部爲初陵。","content_fanyi":"闰正月，汉成帝将渭城延陵亭一带选定为初陵，并开始营建延陵。","content_jianti_auto":"2闰月，以渭城延陵亭部为初陵。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":2343,"number":2,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第三十 (漢紀二十二) / 孝成皇帝上之上 / 二年 / 第 2 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"91bbcdca-db0e-11ef-b4fa-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-31},"tongjian_id":"91bbcdca-db0e-11ef-b4fa-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":6},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"渭城","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"渭城","place_name_jianti_auto":"渭城","resolved_place_entity_id":1950,"start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"928a9ef4-db0e-11ef-a7de-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"9秋，七月，以渭城西北原上永陵亭部爲初陵，勿徙郡國民。","content_fanyi":"秋季，七月，汉哀帝选定渭城西北原上永陵亭一带作为初陵，不迁徙郡国百姓去那里居住。","content_jianti_auto":"9秋，七月，以渭城西北原上永陵亭部为初陵，勿徙郡国民。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":2624,"number":9,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第三十四 (漢紀二十六) / 孝哀皇帝中 / 建平二年 / 第 14 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"928a9ef3-db0e-11ef-9f1c-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-5},"tongjian_id":"928a9ef3-db0e-11ef-9f1c-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":7},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"渭城","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"賢","people_name_jianti_auto":"贤","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"94e5c773-db0e-11ef-b60e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"賢曰：嫺，音閑。嫺雅，猶言沈靜也；余謂嫺，習也。屈原傳：嫺於辭令。","note_content_jianti_auto":"贤曰：娴，音闲。娴雅，犹言沈静也；余谓娴，习也。屈原传：娴于辞令。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"94e5c772-db0e-11ef-bf03-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"賢","people_name_jianti_auto":"贤","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"94e5c776-db0e-11ef-a41e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"卒，子恤翻；終也。賢曰：稟，受也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"卒，子恤翻；终也。贤曰：禀，受也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":67,"tongjian_id":"94e5c775-db0e-11ef-8d60-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"賢","people_name_jianti_auto":"贤","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"94e5c778-db0e-11ef-96e8-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"渭城","place_name_jianti_auto":"渭城","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"94e5c779-db0e-11ef-ba59-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"咸陽縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"咸阳县","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"94e5c77a-db0e-11ef-8ed4-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"前書音義曰：試守者，試守一歲乃爲眞，食其全俸。賢曰：渭城，縣名，故城在今咸陽縣東北。","note_content_jianti_auto":"前书音义曰：试守者，试守一岁乃为真，食其全俸。贤曰：渭城，县名，故城在今咸阳县东北。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":87,"tongjian_id":"94e5c777-db0e-11ef-a214-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"渭城","place_name_jianti_auto":"渭城","resolved_place_entity_id":1950,"start_index":83,"tongjian_id":"94e5c786-db0e-11ef-8055-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"初，勃年十二，能誦詩、書，常候援兄況，辭言嫺雅，援裁知書，見之自失。況知其意，乃自酌酒慰援曰：「朱勃小器速成，智盡此耳，卒當從汝稟學，勿畏也。」勃未二十，右扶風請試守渭城宰。及援爲將軍封侯，而勃位不過縣令。援後雖貴，常待以舊恩而卑侮之，勃愈身自親。及援遇讒，唯勃能終焉。","content_fanyi":"当初，朱勃十二岁时，已经能背诵《诗经》《尚书》，经常去探望马援的兄长马况，言辞娴雅，马援那时刚刚读书，见到他后自觉不如，怅然自失。马况了解马援的心意，就亲自斟酒安慰他说：“朱勃是小器速成，才智也不过如此罢了，终究要向你学习，不要畏惧。”朱勃不到二十岁，右扶风就请他试任渭城县宰。等到马援做了将军、封了侯，朱勃的官位仍不过是个县令。马援后来虽然尊贵，仍常常念及马家旧日对朱勃的恩情而照顾他，却又轻视、凌辱他，朱勃反而更加谦恭，亲自亲近马援。等到马援遭受谗言时，只有朱勃能够始终如一地对待马援。","content_jianti_auto":"初，勃年十二，能诵诗、书，常候援兄况，辞言娴雅，援裁知书，见之自失。况知其意，乃自酌酒慰援曰：「朱勃小器速成，智尽此耳，卒当从汝禀学，勿畏也。」勃未二十，右扶风请试守渭城宰。及援为将军封侯，而勃位不过县令。援后虽贵，常待以旧恩而卑侮之，勃愈身自亲。及援遇谗，唯勃能终焉。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3452,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第四十四 (漢紀三十六) / 世祖光武皇帝下 / 二十五年 / 第 11 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"94e5c771-db0e-11ef-b3b2-a0d3651f611f","year_int":49},"tongjian_id":"94e5c771-db0e-11ef-b3b2-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":8},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"渭城","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"周宣王","people_name_jianti_auto":"周宣王","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"9dc52b46-db0e-11ef-8738-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"鄭桓公","people_name_jianti_auto":"郑桓公","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"9dc52b47-db0e-11ef-a3f6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"鄭縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"郑县","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9dc52b48-db0e-11ef-a980-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"京兆郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"京兆郡","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"9dc52b49-db0e-11ef-aca4-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"唐","place_name_jianti_auto":"唐","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"9dc52b4a-db0e-11ef-a553-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"華州","place_name_jianti_auto":"华州","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"9dc52b4b-db0e-11ef-865b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"鄭縣，屬京兆郡，周宣王弟鄭桓公封邑；唐屬華州。","note_content_jianti_auto":"郑县，属京兆郡，周宣王弟郑桓公封邑；唐属华州。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"9dc52b45-db0e-11ef-8bcc-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"石勒","people_name_jianti_auto":"石勒","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"9dc52b4d-db0e-11ef-8a2f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"渭城縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"渭城县","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9dc52b4e-db0e-11ef-8944-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"9dc52b4f-db0e-11ef-913a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"咸陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"咸阳","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"9dc52b50-db0e-11ef-ae59-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"前漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"前汉","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"9dc52b51-db0e-11ef-aa70-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"扶風","place_name_jianti_auto":"扶风","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"9dc52b52-db0e-11ef-a267-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"後漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"后汉","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"9dc52b53-db0e-11ef-85fa-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"石安縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"石安县","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"9dc52b54-db0e-11ef-9d94-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"唐","place_name_jianti_auto":"唐","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"9dc52b55-db0e-11ef-8fe8-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"咸陽縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"咸阳县","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"9dc52b56-db0e-11ef-b4cf-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"京兆","place_name_jianti_auto":"京兆","start_index":41,"tongjian_id":"9dc52b57-db0e-11ef-b03b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"渭城縣，故秦咸陽也；前漢屬扶風，後漢省，而地名猶在；石勒置石安縣；唐復爲咸陽縣，屬京兆。","note_content_jianti_auto":"渭城县，故秦咸阳也；前汉属扶风，后汉省，而地名犹在；石勒置石安县；唐复为咸阳县，属京兆。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"9dc52b4c-db0e-11ef-9a19-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"好畤縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"好畤县","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9dc52b59-db0e-11ef-8c3d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"前漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"前汉","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"9dc52b5a-db0e-11ef-a645-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"扶風","place_name_jianti_auto":"扶风","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"9dc52b5b-db0e-11ef-afc8-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"後漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"后汉","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"9dc52b5c-db0e-11ef-92c6-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"晉","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"9dc52b5d-db0e-11ef-9615-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"唐","place_name_jianti_auto":"唐","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"9dc52b5e-db0e-11ef-9c01-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"醴泉","place_name_jianti_auto":"醴泉","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"9dc52b5f-db0e-11ef-a913-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"好畤縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"好畤县","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"9dc52b60-db0e-11ef-8dff-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"京兆","place_name_jianti_auto":"京兆","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"9dc52b61-db0e-11ef-8aca-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"好畤縣，前漢屬扶風，後漢、晉省；唐武德二年，復分醴泉置好畤縣，屬京兆。","note_content_jianti_auto":"好畤县，前汉属扶风，后汉、晋省；唐武德二年，复分醴泉置好畤县，属京兆。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":37,"tongjian_id":"9dc52b58-db0e-11ef-8cb6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"9dc52b44-db0e-11ef-9d9a-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"zhì","source_anchor_text":"逆戰於好畤夔兵敗顒","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":35,"text":"畤","tongjian_id":"2209b950-513b-5a16-896d-4a9fa370453f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"渭城","place_name_jianti_auto":"渭城","resolved_place_entity_id":1950,"start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"9dc52b66-db0e-11ef-89e6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/一、西安府（卷五十三）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"雍州刺史刘沈起兵新平，进讨颙，颙因还屯渭城。大宁三年，刘...","context_before":"...孝公所居也。汉元鼎三年，渭城县置于此。后汉县废而城如故。","source_end_index":77,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"b3015bee-722e-5cbd-b334-4c00c34faa11","source_start_index":47,"source_text":"晋永安初，河间王颙镇关中，遣军犯洛阳。颙顷军于郑，为之声援。"},{"context_after":"大宁三年，刘曜以其子胤为大单于，置单于台于渭城是也]。","context_before":"...安初，河间王颙镇关中，遣军犯洛阳。颙顷军于郑，为之声援。","source_end_index":99,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"b3015bee-722e-5cbd-b334-4c00c34faa11","source_start_index":77,"source_text":"雍州刺史刘沈起兵新平，进讨颙，颙因还屯渭城。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/一、西安府（卷五十三）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/二、西安府下（卷五十四）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"太元九年，慕容冲自华阴进向长安。苻坚使苻晖拒之，战于郑西...","context_before":"...属京兆。后汉初，赤眉入关，立刘盆子于郑北。晋亦属京兆郡。","source_end_index":108,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"614bf3b9-d33a-5276-9595-b2f239542993","source_start_index":84,"source_text":"太安二年，河间王颙起兵长安，东逼京师，顿军于郑。"},{"context_after":"后魏太和十一年，改置汉西县，属武功郡。隋开皇十八年，又改...","context_before":"...于好畤。后因置县，属右扶风。后汉初，封耿弇为侯邑，后废。","source_end_index":129,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"ce27b2e8-e977-5c5e-b2e9-cc1e091ba30f","source_start_index":97,"source_text":"晋永安初，雍州刺史刘沈自新平讨河间王颙，败颙将虞夔于好畤，即此。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/二、西安府下（卷五十四）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"河間王顒頓軍於鄭，爲東軍聲援，聞劉沈兵起，還鎭渭城，遣督護虞夔逆戰於好畤。夔兵敗，顒懼，退入長安，急召張方。方掠洛中官私奴婢萬餘人而西。軍中乏食，殺人雜牛馬肉食之。","content_fanyi":"河间王司马颙驻军在郑县，声援东军，听说刘沈起兵，便回军镇守渭城，派遣督护虞夔到好畤迎战。虞夔兵败，司马颙恐惧，退入长安，紧急召回张方。张方劫掠洛阳官府和私家的奴婢一万余人向西而去。军中缺粮，便杀人，把人肉与牛马肉混在一起吃。","content_jianti_auto":"河间王颙顿军于郑，为东军声援，闻刘沈兵起，还镇渭城，遣督护虞夔逆战于好畤。夔兵败，颙惧，退入长安，急召张方。方掠洛中官私奴婢万余人而西。军中乏食，杀人杂牛马肉食之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":7257,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第八十五 (晉紀七) / 孝惠皇帝中之下 / 永興元年 / 第 4 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"9dc52b44-db0e-11ef-9d9a-a0d3651f611f","year_int":304},"tongjian_id":"9dc52b44-db0e-11ef-9d9a-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":9},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"渭城","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"渭城","place_name_jianti_auto":"渭城","resolved_place_entity_id":1950,"start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"9fef2f39-db0e-11ef-af30-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/一、西安府（卷五十三）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"]。","context_before":"...，为之声援。雍州刺史刘沈起兵新平，进讨颙，颙因还屯渭城。","source_end_index":124,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"b3015bee-722e-5cbd-b334-4c00c34faa11","source_start_index":99,"source_text":"大宁三年，刘曜以其子胤为大单于，置单于台于渭城是也"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/一、西安府（卷五十三）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"14趙主曜以永安王胤爲大司馬、大單于，徙封南陽王，置單于臺于渭城，其左、右賢王以下，皆以胡、羯、鮮卑、氐、羌豪桀爲之。","content_fanyi":"前赵主刘曜任命永安王刘胤做大司马兼大单于，并把他徙封为南阳王；又在渭城建立单于台，单于台所属的左、右贤王以下各官，一概由匈奴、羯、鲜卑、氐、羌等族的豪杰来担任。","content_jianti_auto":"14赵主曜以永安王胤为大司马、大单于，徙封南阳王，置单于台于渭城，其左、右贤王以下，皆以胡、羯、鲜卑、氐、羌豪桀为之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":7975,"number":14,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第九十三 (晉紀十五) / 肅宗明皇帝下 / 三年 / 第 14 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"9fef2f30-db0e-11ef-9711-a0d3651f611f","year_int":325},"tongjian_id":"9fef2f30-db0e-11ef-9711-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":10}],"page_size":10,"total_pages":2,"total_paragraphs":11},"place_name":"渭城"},"message":"success","success":true}